homelab-postgres-exporter (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: wraps the Ubuntu-archive prometheus-postgres-exporter
    for the fleet DB host. Bootstraps a read-only 'homelab_exporter'
    Postgres role (pg_monitor) via local sudo -u postgres, writes the
    exporter DATA_SOURCE_NAME (root:prometheus 0640), and advertises the
    exporter (kind: metrics-exporter, :9187) so homelab-prometheus
    discovers + scrapes it. Install on the PostgreSQL host.

 -- Jeff Gardner <mailmasker-api01@forge.name>  Tue, 30 Sep 2026 15:45:00 -0500
